# AuthKnot Repository Structure

This is a monorepo for the AuthKnot trust infrastructure platform.

## Top-level layout

- `backend/` — FastAPI backend service
- `worker/` — Async worker tier (graph jobs, batch recomputation, exports)
- `frontend/operator-console/` — React operator console (shadcn/ui + TanStack Query)
- `frontend/marketing/` — Marketing site
- `frontend/trust-profile/` — Public trust profile surface
- `infra/` — Infrastructure configuration
- `docs/` — Documentation (PRD, architecture, ADRs, runbooks)
- `scripts/` — Dev and CI scripts

## Rules

- Do not touch unrelated files when working on a task.
- Keep backend and frontend concerns strictly separated.
- All database changes must go through Alembic migrations.
- Never commit secrets or credentials.
